stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> NeedHeader
  NeedHeader --> NeedHeader: buffered < 4 bytes / return nullopt
  NeedHeader --> TooLarge: n > kMaxFrame
  NeedHeader --> NeedBody: 4 bytes buffered / n = big-endian u32
  NeedBody --> NeedBody: buffered < 4 + n / return nullopt
  NeedBody --> NeedHeader: 4 + n buffered / parse, consume 4 + n, return Frame
  TooLarge --> [*]: throw, close connection
